  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Join our annual Global Run, 2023 edition: Support refugees by donating to Yoga and Sport With Refugees and help us to continue building happier and healthier communities through the power of sport. We invite you to get involved! Run alongside us on the 10th of September by joining one our organised runs (Berlin, Athens, Paris and more) or simply going out and running with friends in solidarity with people on the move.</narrative>
